1
00:03:33,599 --> 00:03:39,599
Still together, still lost.

2
00:07:07,199 --> 00:07:13,199
Madagascar: Escape 2 Africa is a adventure, animation,
comedy film directed by Eric Darnell.

3
00:10:40,799 --> 00:10:46,799
Alex, Marty, and other zoo animals find a way to escape from
Madagascar when the penguins reassemble a wrecked airplane.

4
00:14:14,399 --> 00:14:20,399
The precariously repaired craft stays airborne just long
enough to make it to the African continent.

5
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:54,000
There the New Yorkers encounter members of their own species for the first time.

6
00:21:21,599 --> 00:21:27,599
Africa proves to be a wild place, but Alex and company wonder
if it is better than their Central Park home.

7
00:24:55,200 --> 00:25:01,200
Alex (voice), played by Ben Stiller.

8
00:28:28,799 --> 00:28:34,799
Marty / Additional Zebras (voice), played by Chris Rock.

9
00:32:02,399 --> 00:32:08,399
Melman (voice), played by David Schwimmer.

10
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:42,000
Gloria (voice), played by Jada Pinkett Smith.

11
00:39:09,599 --> 00:39:15,599
Julien (voice), played by Sacha Baron Cohen.

12
00:42:43,199 --> 00:42:49,199
Maurice (voice), played by Cedric the Entertainer.

13
00:46:16,799 --> 00:46:22,799
Madagascar: Escape 2 Africa (also known as Madagascar 2: Escape to Africa) is a 2008 American animated adventure
comedy film directed by Eric Darnell and Tom McGrath and written by  Etan Cohen, Darnell and McGrath.

14
00:49:50,400 --> 00:49:56,400
The second installment in the Madagascar film series, following the
2005 film, it was produced by DreamWorks Animation SKG.

15
00:53:24,000 --> 00:53:30,000
Ben Stiller, Chris Rock, David Schwimmer, Jada Pinkett Smith, Sacha Baron Cohen, Cedric the Entertainer, Andy Richter, Elisa Gabrielli, McGrath, Chris Miller, Christopher
Knights, and Conrad Vernon reprise their roles from the first film, joined by new cast members Bernie Mac, Alec Baldwin, Sherri Shepherd, and will.i.am.

16
00:56:57,599 --> 00:57:03,599
In the film, the main characters, a party of animals from the Central Park Zoo whose adventures have taken them to Madagascar find
themselves in the African savannas, where they meet others of their species and where Alex the lion reunites with his parents.

17
01:00:31,199 --> 01:00:37,199
The film, like its predecessor, has a score composed by Hans Zimmer.

18
01:04:04,799 --> 01:04:10,799
Singer will.i.am contributed five songs to the soundtrack.

19
01:07:38,400 --> 01:07:44,400
Released by Paramount Pictures on November 7, 2008, Madagascar: Escape 2 Africa received generally positive reviews from critics,
who praised its characters, humor and animation, while also considering it an improvement over its predecessor.

20
01:11:12,000 --> 01:11:18,000
It grossed $604 million on a $150 million budget, making it
the sixth highest-grossing film of 2008.

21
01:14:45,599 --> 01:14:51,599
It was dedicated to Bernie Mac, who died before the film's release.

22
01:18:19,199 --> 01:18:25,199
A sequel, Madagascar 3: Europe's Most Wanted, was released in 2012.

23
01:21:52,800 --> 01:21:58,800
The film explores themes of dance, friendship, jealousy, airplane, africa.

24
01:25:26,399 --> 01:25:32,399
The tone is lighthearted.
